@host = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### Register a contributor
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "readingcontributor",
  "email": "readingcontributor@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "displayName": "Reading Contributor"
}

### Login as the contributor
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "readingcontributor",
  "password": "password123",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### Import a comic to attach reading entries to
# @name importComic
POST {{host}}/api/catalog/myanimelist/2
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Submit - propose a new source alongside the entry (source starts PENDING, chained into the requests below)
# @name submitWithNewSource
POST {{host}}/api/comics/{{importComic.response.body.$.slug}}/reading-entries
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

{
  "sourceName": "MangaDex",
  "sourceUrl": "https://mangadex.org",
  "url": "https://mangadex.org/title/abc123",
  "locale": "es-ES"
}

### Submit - reuse the source just created for a second entry on the same comic -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/comics/{{importComic.response.body.$.slug}}/reading-entries
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

{
  "sourceId": {{submitWithNewSource.response.body.$.source.id}},
  "url": "https://mangadex.org/title/abc123/chapter-1",
  "locale": "es-ES"
}

### Submit - duplicate (same comic, source and url as the first submit) -> 409 (DuplicateComicReadingEntryException)
POST {{host}}/api/comics/{{importComic.response.body.$.slug}}/reading-entries
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

{
  "sourceId": {{submitWithNewSource.response.body.$.source.id}},
  "url": "https://mangadex.org/title/abc123",
  "locale": "es-ES"
}

### Submit - both sourceId and new-source details -> 400 (mutually exclusive, @AssertTrue on the DTO)
POST {{host}}/api/comics/{{importComic.response.body.$.slug}}/reading-entries
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

{
  "sourceId": {{submitWithNewSource.response.body.$.source.id}},
  "sourceName": "MangaDex",
  "sourceUrl": "https://mangadex.org",
  "url": "https://mangadex.org/title/xyz",
  "locale": "es-ES"
}

### Submit - neither sourceId nor new-source details -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/comics/{{importComic.response.body.$.slug}}/reading-entries
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

{
  "url": "https://mangadex.org/title/xyz",
  "locale": "es-ES"
}

### Submit - malformed url -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/comics/{{importComic.response.body.$.slug}}/reading-entries
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

{
  "sourceId": {{submitWithNewSource.response.body.$.source.id}},
  "url": "not-a-url",
  "locale": "es-ES"
}

### Submit - locale isn't a real ISO language -> 400 (@ValidLocale)
POST {{host}}/api/comics/{{importComic.response.body.$.slug}}/reading-entries
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

{
  "sourceId": {{submitWithNewSource.response.body.$.source.id}},
  "url": "https://mangadex.org/title/xyz",
  "locale": "xx"
}

### Submit - no Authorization header -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/comics/{{importComic.response.body.$.slug}}/reading-entries
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "sourceId": {{submitWithNewSource.response.body.$.source.id}},
  "url": "https://mangadex.org/title/xyz",
  "locale": "es-ES"
}

### Submit - unknown comic slug -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/comics/does-not-exist/reading-entries
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

{
  "sourceId": {{submitWithNewSource.response.body.$.source.id}},
  "url": "https://mangadex.org/title/xyz",
  "locale": "es-ES"
}

### List - every entry for the comic, PENDING included by default -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/comics/{{importComic.response.body.$.slug}}/reading-entries

### List - filtered by status, nothing APPROVED yet -> 200 empty
GET {{host}}/api/comics/{{importComic.response.body.$.slug}}/reading-entries?status=APPROVED

### List - unknown comic slug -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/comics/does-not-exist/reading-entries

### Approve - no Authorization header -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/reading-entries/{{submitWithNewSource.response.body.$.id}}/approve

### Approve - authenticated but not ADMIN -> 403
POST {{host}}/api/reading-entries/{{submitWithNewSource.response.body.$.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### Approve - as ADMIN, but the source isn't APPROVED yet -> 409 (ComicReadingSourceNotApprovedException)
# There's no endpoint to approve a ComicReadingSource yet (only entries) - getting one to
# APPROVED for real testing today means updating it directly:
#   UPDATE comic_reading_source SET status = 'APPROVED' WHERE id = <source id>;
# @adminToken below needs a JWT for a user whose role is ADMIN - promote one by hand, e.g.
#   UPDATE app_user SET role = 'ADMIN' WHERE username = 'readingcontributor';
# then log in again so the token actually carries that claim.
@adminToken = REPLACE_ME
POST {{host}}/api/reading-entries/{{submitWithNewSource.response.body.$.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reject - as ADMIN, doesn't require the source to be approved -> 200
POST {{host}}/api/reading-entries/{{submitWithNewSource.response.body.$.id}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reject - already reviewed (rejected above) -> 409 (ComicReadingEntryAlreadyReviewedException)
POST {{host}}/api/reading-entries/{{submitWithNewSource.response.body.$.id}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
